   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2021-04-22",
   "text": "Fairness in Nursing Home Arbitration Act\n This bill prohibits, and nullifies any existing, pre-dispute arbitration agreements with respect to Medicare skilled nursing facilities or Medicaid nursing facilities, home- and community-based services, or home health care services."
